#. module: resource
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:resource.field_resource_calendar__calendar_type model:ir.model.fields,help:resource.field_resource_calendar_attendance__calendar_type
msgid ""
"\n"
"    - Fixed: a weekly attendance pattern that repeats identically every week.\n"
"    - Variable: attendances set on specific dates rather than a repeating weekly pattern, such as a one-off schedule or a multi-week rotation.\n"
"    - Undefined: no predefined slots at all. The resource can work whenever it wants, optionally up to an hours target.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

